# Everything is stored and checked out with LF, so text formats round-trip byte-identically
# [DOC-21] and shell scripts run in Git Bash, Linux and macOS alike.
* text=auto eol=lf
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.ttf binary
*.hdr binary
*.exr binary
*.ktx2 binary
*.glb binary
*.antmpl binary
*.anchar binary
*.anthair binary
*.bin binary
*.ply binary
